  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[G] [Gmaj7] [G] [Gmaj7]\n[Dsus2] [D]\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[Dsus2] [D] [G]He could've tuned in, tuned in [Gmaj7]But he tuned out\n[G]A bad time, nothing could [Gmaj7]save him\n[Dsus2] [D] [Dsus2] [D] [G]Alone in a corridor, [Gmaj7]waiting, locked out\n[G]He got up outta there, ran for [Gmaj7]hundreds of miles [Dsus2] [D]\n[Dsus2] [D] [G]He made it to the ocean, had a [Gmaj7]smoke in a tree\n[G]The wind rose up, set him down [Gmaj7]on his knee\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[Dsus2] [D] [Dsus2] [D] [Dsus2] [D]\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[Dsus2] [D] [G]A wave came crashing like a fist to the jaw\n[D]Delivered him wings, \"Hey, look at me now\"\n[G]Arms wide open with the sea as his floor\nOh, power, oh\n[D]\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Csus4]He's flying [Bsus4] [Asus4]Whole\n[Gadd9]\n[Csus4]High, [Bsus4]wide, [Asus4] [Gadd9] [G9/F]oh\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[G] [Gmaj7] [G] [Gmaj7]\n[Dsus2] [D]\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[Dsus2] [D] [G]He floated back down cause he [Gmaj7]wanted to share\n[G]His key to the locks on the chains [Gmaj7]he saw [Dsus2] [D]everywhere\n[Dsus2] [D] [G]But first he was stripped and then [Gmaj7]he was stabbed\n[G]By faceless men, well, fuckers\n[Gmaj7]He still stands [Dsus2] [D]\n\n{section: Verso 4}\n[Dsus2] [D] [G]And he still gives his love, he just gives it away\n[D]The love he receives is the love that is saved\n[G]And sometimes is seen a strange spot in the sky\n[D]A human being that was given to fly\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Csus4]He's flying [Bsus4] [Asus4]Whole\n[Gadd9]\n[Csus4]High, flying, [Bsus4] [Asus4] [Gadd9] [Csus4]oh\n[Bsus4]He's [Asus4]flying\n[Csus4]Whole\n[Bsus4]High, [Asus4]oh, [Gadd9]oh\n\n{section: Outro}\n[Gadd9] [Dsus4] (x8)\n[Gadd9]"
